Title:  Pissing down with rain

Seq:    5.7.1.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Aspinall, Neil|Neil Aspinall]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Beatles Anthology (Aspinall)|The Beatles Anthology]]*


Body:

When we arrived in Sydney it was pissing down with rain. We got off the plane and they put The Beatles on the back of a flat-back truck so the crowd could see them.


